---
import { solutions } from '../../data/site';
---

<section class="py-8 md:py-12 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-container-max-width mx-auto px-6 md:px-8">
    <header data-reveal class="max-w-3xl mb-6 md:mb-10">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent-teal mb-2 md:mb-3">4 nhóm giải pháp</p>
      <h2 class="font-headline-md text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-ink-dark mb-3 md:mb-4">
        Lựa chọn giải pháp phù hợp ngành của bạn
      </h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
        Mỗi phân khúc được xây dựng theo pain points thực tế, case study có số liệu và quy trình
        triển khai 6 bước nhất quán.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div data-reveal-stagger class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 md:gap-12">
      {
        solutions.map((item) => (
          <a
            data-reveal
            href={`/giai-phap/${item.slug}`}
            class="group grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_140px] gap-3 sm:gap-6 items-center no-underline text-inherit py-4 sm:py-5 md:border-0"
          >
            <figure class="order-first sm:order-2 m-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg aspect-[4/3] w-full min-w-0">
              <img
                alt={item.title}
                class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
                src={item.image}
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </figure>
            <div class="order-last sm:order-1 min-w-0">
              <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-ink-dark mb-2 sm:mb-3 group-hover:text-accent-gold transition-colors">
                {item.title}
              </h3>
              <p class="text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3 sm:mb-4">{item.desc}</p>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-accent-teal group-hover:underline">
                Xem chi tiết
              </span>
            </div>
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
